{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwSq97V6M1G18jw4SR9i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The dashboard and the alert rule both exist, and the rule is enabled. Reading them back from Kibana, the dashboard has all its panels and the rule's status is `ok`.\n\n**1. What the data holds.** The `kibana_sample_data_logs` data view has 14,074 web requests timestamped from Oct 4 to Dec 3, 2026, using the `timestamp` field. Each request records:\n- client IP\n- URL and request\n- response code\n- bytes\n- geo source and destination\n- OS, agent, extension and tags\n\nThe response code is stored as text, and only three codes appear: 200 (12,832 requests), 404 (801) and 503 (441).\n\n**2. Dashboard \"EFF-443292cf Web logs overview\"** has 7 panels: http://localhost:15601/app/dashboards#/view/eff-443292cf-web-logs-overview-f59faf84b4cf\n- Single-number panels for total requests, unique visitors (distinct client IPs) and total bytes served.\n- A bar chart of requests over time, split by response code.\n- A pie chart of response codes.\n- A table of the top 10 URLs, with request count and bytes.\n- A bar chart of requests by source country (top 10).\n\n**3. Alert rule \"EFF-443292cf 5xx spike\"** (id `753ccaa3-3cc6-4a54-b835-2b835a6667bb`):\n- It runs every minute against `kibana_sample_data_logs`.\n- It counts requests whose response code starts with \"5\", using the `timestamp` field.\n- It fires when there are more than 10 in the last 5 minutes.\n\nThe rule has no actions attached, so when it fires the alert shows up in Kibana but no notification is sent. Add a connector (Slack, email, etc.) if you want to be notified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":682,"cache_read_input_tokens":21572,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":682},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4eb1cb7-866c-5bbf-8d81-a8d5acd83be3","uuid":"08ac6c67-dbf1-46bf-a471-ae0946269f70","timestamp":"2026-10-12T01:06:19.027Z","request_id":"req_011CfwSq8qsNKXd6fyiYAUKD"}
